  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Set your air fryer to 200°C. Cut or tear each spinach falafel into quarters (don't worry if they crumble!).\n• Drizzle or spray with olive oil, then place in air fryer basket and cook until heated through, 4-5 minutes.\n• TIP: No air fryer? No worries. In a large frying pan over medium-high heat, coat the base with olive oil and fry falafels until golden brown, 5-8 minutes. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ff119eee067c9eb8df4f4/step-9ccff000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop cos lettuce.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Thinly slice radish.\n• In a small bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt, half of the dukkah and a drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ff119eee067c9eb8df4f4/step-d9799810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To a large bowl, add cos, snacking tomatoes, and radish. Pick mint leaves, then tear into the salad along with parsley. Combine with a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Season to taste.\n• Microwave pita bread on a plate until warmed through, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ff119eee067c9eb8df4f4/step-52308d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Halve pita bread and spread with garlic sauce.\n• Fill with some salad and the falafels, then drizzle with dukkah yoghurt and sprinkle over remaining dukkah.\n• Divide spinach falafel pita pockets between plates. Serve with remaining herby salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ff119eee067c9eb8df4f4/step-6f33c630.jpg"
    }
  ]
